    s "你知道吗，这条蜥蜴是在嫉妒我，因为我成了你在莫肯的第一个朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_14129aa2:

    # s "So as a really friendly friend, you should be calling me Seb now, as a term of endearment."
    s "既然我们是这么要好的朋友，你现在就该叫我塞布，作为亲昵的称呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_b3607adf:

    # e "Oh! Alright Seb!"
    e "噢！好啊，塞布！"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_2254872f:

    # s "Hehe, good boy."
    s "嘿嘿，乖孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_ea4c03a9:

    # o "Come on, kid. Let's get you to the bed first, I'll take care of the lion later."
    o "来，小家伙。先把你送到床上，狮子的事我之后再处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_2d601987:

    # s "Hey what do you mean?"
    s "喂，你这是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_53e2de71:

    # o "You will get what I mean. [e], let's go."
    o "你待会儿就知道我是什么意思了。[e]，走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_c965f06b:

    # "You arrived at the entrance of Sebas and Ole's shop, in the corner of your vision you see a wolf standing alone in a distance, staring at the three of you."
    "你们来到塞巴斯和奥利的店铺门口。余光中，你看见远处独自站着一匹狼，正盯着你们三人。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_cb97f0c7:

    # "He seems curious, if not cautious. You quickly avert your gaze back to the duo."
    "他似乎是好奇，也可能是警惕。你赶紧移开视线，重新看向那两人。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_fa38a6b5:

    # s "Here it is! The magnificent sign, {size=-10}made by me by the way{/size}. Isn't it beautiful?"
    s "看，这就是那块气派的大招牌！{size=-10}顺便说一句，是我做的{/size}。漂亮吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_e86936fd:

    # e "Oh? It's looking good!"
    e "哦？看起来不错！"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_c461cd93:

    # s "I told you so Ole, everyone loves it."
    s "我就说吧，奥利，人人都喜欢它。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_57ff942c:

    # o "Our kid here's just being polite."
    o "咱们这位小家伙只是在客气而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_4420625b:

    # s "Why're you calling [e] kid. He looks at most only a few years younger than you."
    s "你干吗叫[e]小家伙？他看起来顶多只比你小几岁。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_27bf0577:

    # s "[e], hey. This weirdo lizard here is only 27. Don't get fooled by his croaky voice."
    s "嘿，[e]。这条怪蜥蜴才27岁。别被他沙哑的声音骗了。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_e9de62d4:

    # "Sebas points at Ole, while whispering to you."
    "塞巴斯指着奥利，同时对你低声耳语。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_4f11e705:

    # o "Seb, did you really think I can't hear you from over here."
    o "塞布，你真以为我站在这儿会听不见你吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_b42d4a4a:

    # "Ole puts his left fist behind Sebas's back, striking him forcefully with the knuckles of his hand."
    "奥利将左拳藏到塞巴斯背后，用指关节狠狠地敲了上去。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_cc9c216e:

    # s2 "STOPPP, A-ALRIGHT. I GET IT, TOUGH OLD GUY. STOPPP!"
    s2 "住手——啊，好、好了。我知道了，强硬的老家伙。住手啊啊啊！"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_850cd759:

    # "You look in shock and surprise as the lion gets his spine slammed, slumping forwards instinctively as Ole laughs and looks back at you."
    "你震惊又错愕地看着狮子的脊背遭到重击，身体本能地向前弯下；奥利大笑着回头看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_84f6419d:

    # o "Good. Anyways kid, why don't we take a look at the store."
    o "很好。好了，小家伙，不如我们进去看看店里吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_3ae4a28f:

    # e "Ok...?"
    e "好……？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_2497b5fc:

    # "You follow Ole closely, while glancing backwards at the lion still hunching and nudging at his back."
    "你紧跟奥利，同时不时回头瞥一眼那头仍弓着身子、不断蹭着他后背的狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_be6601fa:

    # o "Welcome to the King's Pawn. We sell general goods and we do a little pawning!"
    o "欢迎来到“君临典当”。我们卖各种日用品，也做些典当生意！"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_65736a62:

    # s "Hey! Stop stealing my lines."
    s "喂！别偷我的台词。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_f3c0c1a2:

    # o "Anyways, the storage room is over there in the back, it already came with the wooden bed someone sold us earlier. Seb will tidy it up for you."
    o "总之，储物间就在后面，那儿已经有一张之前有人卖给我们的木床了。塞巴斯会替你收拾好。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_28c99800:

    # s "What, me? Isn't it your job?"
    s "什么，我？这不是你的工作吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_5d838ea5:

    # o "Hey! No talking back in front of our guests."
    o "喂！当着客人的面不许顶嘴。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_2c9e55e2:

    # s "...this fucking lizard."
    s "……这条该死的蜥蜴。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_6a7235b3:

    # "You can only see Ole fiercely stares back at Sebas without a single word, before the lion quickly slip away into the storage room."
    "只见奥利一言不发地狠狠瞪回塞巴斯，随后那头狮子迅速溜进了储物间。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_b93ce594:

    # o "So, what do you think?"
    o "那么，你觉得怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_0541f135:

    # e "This place looks cozy, think I can stay here forever."
    e "这里看起来很温馨，我觉得自己可以永远住下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_629301c5:

    # o "Oh? You're not going home?"
    o "哦？你不回家了？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_f6295941:

    # e "Uhh- No... That's just exaggeration, but I really do appreciate the place you have here."
    e "呃——不……我只是夸张地说说，但我真的很喜欢你们这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_74eec826:

    # "You awkwardly smiles at Ole, who stands beside you and pats your back."
    "你尴尬地朝奥利笑了笑，他站在你身旁，拍了拍你的后背。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_e142ac60:

    # o "Hey... you can definitely stay as long as you wish. Our Seb here have been wanting a company for a long time you know."
    o "嘿……你想住多久都行。我们家塞巴斯可是一直很想有人陪着呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_64c70efd:

    # e "What really? He looks like the type that attracts a lot of friends."
    e "真的吗？他看起来像是很容易交到很多朋友的类型。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_4c0396b3:

    # o "Well... it's still good to see new faces around here, the village is too small, you often see the same faces here once or twice per day."
    o "不过……这里有新面孔总归是件好事。村子太小了，你一天常常会见到同样的几张脸一两次。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_28ac9a49:

    # o "Enough about him, if you want to repay us while you are here, there's a job you might be interested."
    o "先不说他了。你要是想在这里期间报答我们，我这儿有份工作你可能会感兴趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_79bc9ac6:

    # e "What's it?"
    e "什么工作？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_809c6a88:

    # o "We have a lot of goods that's waiting to come to the shop recently."
    o "最近有一大批货正等着送到店里来。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_a3deb9c1:

    # o "So, we would be very grateful if you can be our courier, and deliver those wares between us and our clients."
    o "所以，如果你愿意替我们当送货员，在我们和客户之间运送这些货物，我们会非常感激。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_9fb179f0:

    # e "Oh... That sounds easy."
    e "哦……听起来很简单。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_b7ae69b9:

    # o "The thing is, it's not that easy. The forest is not safe anymore."
    o "问题是，没那么简单。森林已经不再安全了。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_5d19afe3:

    # o "Ever since that someone brought your Chime into our land. A lot of monsters and wild folks are emerging in the wilds. It's a dangerous job if you presume."
    o "自从有人把你的齐门带进我们的土地后，荒野里就冒出了许多怪物和野蛮人。这工作很危险，别想当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_d3ffe870:

    # e "You can count on me, Ole. I'm a good fighter."
    e "放心交给我吧，奥利。我很擅长战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_1f49db0d:

    # e "Maybe I can look for Chime while I'm at it."
    e "或许我也可以顺便找找齐门。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_72fb9c4c:

    # o "That's good to know, kid! Then I'll talk to Seb later, he will give you a messenger bag and map and other materials."
    o "这我就放心了，小子！那我待会儿去跟塞巴斯说一声，他会给你准备一个邮差包、地图，还有其他物资。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_d22a019a:

    # o "We also have a fighter in the village, Lothar. I will ask him to give you some basic training, before you head outside the village."
    o "村里还有个战士，洛萨尔。我会请他在你出村前教你一些基础训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_80f67624:

    # o "I'll think about the detail later, but the point is to prepare you before you try to go back to your tribe."
    o "细节我之后再想，但重点是，在你尝试回到部族之前，得先做好准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_cdbdbb4a:

    # o "You should rest for now, though. The wound is not going to heal itself-"
    o "不过你现在还是该休息。伤口不会自己愈合——"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_85aca341:

    # my "Ole, who are you talking to."
    my "奥利，你在和谁说话？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_d3a9d418:

    # "You hear a mysterious gruff voice from upstairs, you turn your back to the stairs and notice a beefy figure walking down and with his hand along the rails."
    "你听见楼上传来一道神秘而粗哑的声音，转身朝向楼梯，发现一个魁梧的身影扶着栏杆走下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_677bdfcc:

    # "As the figure reveals himself, you see a brown bull with curly hairs, his left hand holding tape measures."
    "随着那道身影现出真容，你看到了一头毛发卷曲的棕色公牛，他的左手拿着软尺。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_37091eee:

    # o "Good morning, Rahim, this guy is [e], He's moving into our shop today."
    o "早上好，雷希姆。这位是[e]，他今天要搬进我们的店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_c9676f75:

    # r "Where did you find this goat, Ole? Don't tell me you invited those people here..."
    r "这只山羊是在哪儿找到的，奥利？别告诉我你把那些人请来了……"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_e4c0ee62:

    # o "From the green forest down south, Sebas and I found him lying there. He is an outsider dragon, so we thought we'd bring him here to be our courier."
    o "在南边的翠绿森林里，我和塞巴斯发现他躺在那里。他是外来的龙，所以我们想把他带到这里，让他当我们的信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_fc40231b:

    # r "Courier? Didn't that fox courier from the town disappeared last week?"
    r "信使？镇上那只狐狸不是上周才失踪的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_e7472d3f:

    # o "Yes, that's why our village should need one for our goods, and your textiles as well."
    o "是啊，这就是为什么我们村需要一名差客来运送货物，也运送你的纺织品。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_e304ada5:

    # r "I suppose."
    r "我想是吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_976d60ef:

    # r "Greetings. [e]. I'm Rahim, the tailor of the village."
    r "你好，[e]。我是雷希姆，村里的裁缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_20779f48:

    # e "Nice to meet you, Rahim."
    e "很高兴见到你，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_1b538649:

    # "You look between Ole and Rahim, trying to force a smile on your face as Rahim suddenly gives you an intimidating look."
    "你在奥利和雷希姆之间来回看看，努力挤出笑容；雷希姆却突然投来一道令人心生畏惧的目光。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_8309ec62:

    # r "A dragon... huh. Didn't know you kinds have this much fur."
    r "龙……是吗。没想到你们这种族身上竟有这么多毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_cf12d602:

    # "Rahim quickly brushes you in the waist, the old bull wraps the tape around your body and tighten it up with a pull, you lightly gasped before he takes the tape away."
    "雷希姆迅速拂过你的腰部，这头老公牛将软尺绕过你的身体，猛地一拉收紧。你轻轻倒吸一口气，他便取走了软尺。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_fffd3e40:

    # e "Ouch! What are you doing?"
    e "哎哟！你在干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_57bec2bd:

    # r "Measuring your waist."
    r "量你的腰围。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_ceeb046a:

    # o "Our Rahim here is a very talented tailor. He worked for the King of Mokken as well."
    o "我们这位雷希姆可是技艺高超的裁缝。他还曾为莫肯国王工作过。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_c323491e:

    # o "He can create any fitting clothes and equipment that makes you feel like heaven."
    o "他什么合身的衣服和装备都做得出来，穿戴上后简直感觉像置身天堂。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_e843ebc4:

    # "Rahim gives Ole a weird look, scoffing off at his compliment."
    "雷希姆古怪地看了奥利一眼，对他的恭维嗤之以鼻。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_7a870539:

    # r "43 inches, did you eat a lot lately?"
    r "43英寸。你最近是不是吃得很多？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_d0ecca60:

    # e "Hmmm... No?"
    e "嗯……没有？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_5235199b:

    # r "Well then you're really fit as a butcher's dog, aren't you."
    r "看来你可真壮实，像屠夫家的狗一样，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_1d855e47:

    # e "U-uhhhh...Thank you?"
    e "呃——呃……谢谢你？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_4c8b1d39:

    # "The tailor puts his tape measure away and turns to Ole."
    "裁缝收起软尺，转身面向奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_c6b4bea3:

    # r "Ole, I thought you and Sebas were out delivering materials today so I checked out your little place, your orders are upstairs."
    r "奥利，我以为你和塞巴斯今天出去送材料了，所以就去看了看你们的小店，你订的货在楼上。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_5146998b:

    # o "Thanks, Rahim. I'll get you the money right away."
    o "谢谢你，雷希姆。我马上把钱给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_20ce69ad:

    # "Ole quickly walks towards the cash register. Rahim glances at you for a moment, before turning back."
    "奥利快步走向收银台。雷希姆瞥了你一眼，随后转回身去。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_7786d099:

    # r "I'll make you a leather armor, it's going to take a couple days, if you want the armor, just go to my place across the road."
    r "我会给你做一套皮甲，要花上几天。你要是想要，就到马路对面的我那儿去。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_1f13c3c3:

    # e "O-ok! Thank you so much, Rahim."
    e "好、好的！太谢谢你了，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_79d54613:

    # o "Here it is."
    o "给，钱在这儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_097a7434:

    # r "Good. See you tomorrow, boy."
    r "好。明天见，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_2b18ef80:

    # r "And you, new lizard, no hanky-panky with the two while I'm away. Got it?"
    r "至于你，新来的蜥蜴，我不在的时候可别和他们两个乱搞。明白吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_cc2a153b:

    # e "Yes... Sir."
    e "是……先生。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_dba9246f:

    # r "Good, see you boys around."
    r "很好，回头见，孩子们。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_cfbe35cb:

    # "The bull steadily tramps outside, giving you another look before closing the door."
    "那头公牛迈着沉重的步子走出门外，关门前又看了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_71e0aa7d:

    # "You can still feel the heavy aura and scent he left behind, you and Ole went silent for a few seconds."
    "你仍能感受到他留下的沉重气场和气味，你和奥利沉默了几秒。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_3d0b0684:

    # o "So... how do you feel about Rahim?"
    o "所以……你觉得雷希姆怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_13492a71:

    # e "I don't know. He's a serious guy for sure."
    e "我不知道。他肯定是个严肃的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_6b712972:

    # o "He had some beef with the goat. You'll get used to him."
    o "他和那只山羊有点过节。你慢慢就会习惯他的。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_cd73264c:

    # "You hear some loud clanking sound emitted from the storage room, with a roaring sound a few seconds after."
    "你听见储物室里传来一阵巨大的金属碰撞声，几秒后又传来一声轰鸣。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_66dce782:

    # s2 "Hey [e], the room is ready!"
    s2 "嘿，[e]，房间收拾好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_30b1a467:

    # "You see a sweaty and exhausted lion walks out of the room, clearly unaccustomed to all the hard cleaning work he did for you."
    "你看见一头汗流浃背、精疲力竭的狮子从房间里走出来，显然他不习惯为你做这么辛苦的清洁工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_37790ec1:

    # o "Alright kid, get in the room and take some rest. We can talk later."
    o "好吧，小子，进房间休息一会儿。我们之后再聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_9527f085:

    # e "Thanks Seb."
    e "谢了，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_821b7e16:

    # "Seb chuckles for a while, You can feel he could hardly hide the elation in his eyes."
    "塞巴斯轻笑了一会儿，你能感觉到他眼中的兴奋几乎藏不住。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_5a30f256:

    # s "You're welcome, buddy. Sleep tight!"
    s "不客气，老铁。睡个好觉！"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_a427aa6e:

    # "You waves to them back and quickly walk into your new room."
    "你朝他们挥手回应，快步走进自己的新房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_76af5441:

    # "As soon as you open the door, your eyes are immediately fixated at a lion plushie, its belly lies a card saying \"Welcome to your new room! [e]\"."
    "你刚打开门，目光便立刻被一只狮子玩偶吸引了。它的肚皮上放着一张卡片，上面写着：“欢迎来到你的新房间！[e]”"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_8e070ba4:

    # "Your heart is instantly melted by Sebas' tender roomwarming gift, You put it at the front of your bed and quickly get in the blanket."
    "塞巴斯送的贴心乔迁礼物让你心都融化了。你把它放在床头，然后赶紧钻进被窝。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_3a90a0b7:

    # s2 "HEY, HOW'S THE ROOMMATE OVER THERE."
    s2 "嘿，新室友，感觉怎么样！"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_32f747ff:

    # "A roaring sound, a mix between excitement and warmth, comes from outside the room. You instantly recognise it as the lion's shout."
    "房外传来一阵咆哮，既兴奋又温暖。你立刻认出那是狮子的吼声。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_60305882:

    # e "I'm fine! The gift is incredible! Thanks Seb!!"
    e "我很好！这礼物太棒了！谢谢你，塞巴斯！！"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_5c5709dd:

    # s2 "Good! I made it last year, just picked it up from the storage, thought you'd probably like that in your room."
    s2 "太好了！这是我去年做的，刚才从储藏室里翻出来，想着你可能会喜欢把它放在房间里。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_fc7182b4:

    # s2 "I have a spare one too, for if you want to get bring me with you outside!"
    s2 "我还有一个备用的，要是你想把我带到外面去的话！"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_d408e786:

    # s2 "Ouch! Ole here is pinching me now. Gotta let you go to bed. Have a nice sleep, new roommate!"
    s2 "哎哟！奥利正在掐我呢。得让你上床睡觉了。新室友，祝你睡个好觉！"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_e7bc7800:

    # "You can still hear Sebas and Ole mumbling outside fondly, You try to listen to them but you find yourself slowly slump over the bed."
    "你仍能听见塞巴斯和奥利在外面亲昵地低声嘟囔。你试着听清他们在说什么，却发现自己慢慢瘫倒在床上。"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_0938c92c:

    # "Without knowing, you drift away to sleep very quickly..."
    "不知不觉间，你很快便沉沉睡去……"

translate schinese_rewrite name_done_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite bedroom_beginning_4255fc2d:

    # "You wake up full of energy, you try to clutch the back of your head but the wound apparently had already healed itself over the night."
    "你精神饱满地醒来，想摸摸后脑勺，却发现伤口似乎已经在夜里自行愈合了。"

translate schinese_rewrite bedroom_beginning_f228f457:

    # "You glance at the drawer and found a brown leather bag, with a journal and a piece of map inside. (You can access them at the bottom right corner of the screen.)"
    "你瞥了眼抽屉，发现里面有一个棕色皮包，内装一本日记和一张地图。（你可以在屏幕右下角找到并打开它们。）"

translate schinese_rewrite bedroom_beginning_ca03823d:

    # "You feel ready to start the day."
    "你已经准备好开始新的一天了。"
